You haven’t seen the facts until you’ve seen the fiction!

2
00:14:40,000 --> 00:14:46,000
Pulp Fiction is a thriller, crime, comedy film directed by Quentin Tarantino.

3
00:22:00,000 --> 00:22:06,000
A burger-loving hit man, his philosophical partner, a drug-addled gangster's moll and
a washed-up boxer converge in this sprawling, comedic crime caper.

4
00:29:20,000 --> 00:29:26,000
Their adventures unfurl in three stories that
ingeniously trip back and forth in time.

5
