11
01:20:40,000 --> 01:20:46,000
Music from the Motion Picture Pulp Fiction is the soundtrack to Quentin Tarantino's
1994 film Pulp Fiction, released on September 27, 1994, by MCA Records.

12
01:28:00,000 --> 01:28:06,000
No traditional film score was commissioned for Pulp Fiction.

13
01:35:20,000 --> 01:35:26,000
The film contains a mix of American rock and roll, surf music, pop and soul.

14
01:42:40,000 --> 01:42:46,000
The soundtrack is equally untraditional, consisting of nine songs from the film, four tracks
of dialogue snippets followed by a song, and three tracks of dialogue alone.

15
01:50:00,000 --> 01:50:06,000
Seven songs featured in the film were not included in
the original 41-minute soundtrack.

16
01:57:20,000 --> 01:57:26,000
The album reached No.

